[00:07.22] You, who brought
[00:09.26] The sunshine to my eyes
[00:44.88] You, who wondered
[00:47.14] Through my sad disguise
[00:49.14] And I have a love
[00:53.44] That cannot die ... for you
[01:10.60] High priestess of my heart
[01:17.28] Tell me that we wont part
[01:24.52] Then lets get together in the sky
[01:30.30] To leave the lonely world
[01:33.60] To wonder why
[01:36.72] For we have a love
[01:39.62] We cant denie ... so true
